      "source_body": "def pinRow (J : PairPinGraph B E) (p : E \u2192 Vec3) (a : E \u00d7 Fin 3) :\n    (B \u2192 Twist) \u2192\u2097[\u211d] \u211d :=\n  (LinearMap.proj a.2).comp ((LinearMap.proj a.1).comp (compatibilityOperator J p))",
